WEBVTT

00:06:58.561 --> 00:07:01.317
(Laughter)

00:07:02.291 --> 00:07:04.320
It's hard to make the better choice,

00:07:04.344 --> 00:07:07.140
and it is so easy to justify a lesser one.

00:07:07.164 --> 00:07:08.202
But --

00:07:08.226 --> 00:07:09.981
when I justify bad choices,

00:07:10.005 --> 00:07:12.924
I make it harder for women
to achieve equality,

00:07:12.948 --> 00:07:14.812
the equality that we all deserve,

00:07:14.836 --> 00:07:16.153
and I need to own that.

00:07:16.533 --> 00:07:19.802
I think of my nieces, ages three and four.

00:07:19.826 --> 00:07:22.265
They are gorgeous
and headstrong, brilliant girls,

00:07:22.289 --> 00:07:23.863
who are a whole lot of brave.

00:07:24.284 --> 00:07:27.201
I want them to thrive in a world
where they are valued

00:07:27.225 --> 00:07:29.553
for the powerful creatures they are.

00:07:29.577 --> 00:07:30.632
I think of them,